west and eu-west. It was unhealthy, with an 18% error rate.\n- **Deploy:** v2.3.2 rolled out to all three regions. Afterwards the service reports healthy, with a 0.2% error rate.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as SEV3. Opening it paged the on-call engineer, as incidents do.\n\n**Approval needs checking:** v2.3.2 had never run in production before, so under policy this deploy needed change-manager approval. I submitted it expecting it to be sent to the approver first, but it went through straight away. Nothing in the response shows whether approval was given. Please confirm the change manager signed off, or get their sign-off after the fact. The incident record notes that the policy applied.", "type": "text"}]}]}